      "sourceTextSha256": "5714b114252bb4b431c27bd726745d590c011b4df4d2887bf7c54e3e7bb9182b",
      "text": "Day 5 · Breakfast. Early pick-up at the hotel (approx. 7:20–8:20 am, depending on the area) for the Brazilian side of the falls. Along the 1,200-metre walkways, enjoy spectacular views of the 275 waterfalls of the Iguazu Falls, including the Floriano, Deodoro, Benjamin Constant and União falls, facing the Devil’s Throat. A panoramic elevator then takes you up to the bus back to the hotel. The day continues with two more excursions.",
